// Arithmetic
2 + 3 => 5
10 - 4 => 6
6 * 7 => 42
10 / 4 => 2.5
2 ^ 10 => 1,024
2 ** 3 => 8
10 mod 3 => 1
2 + 3 * 4 => 14
(2 + 3) * 4 => 20
-2 ^ 2 => -4
2 ^ 3 ^ 2 => 512
-(3 + 4) => -7
5! => 120
3! + 1 => 7

// Unicode and words
6 × 7 => 42
10 ÷ 4 => 2.5
10 − 4 => 6
5 plus 3 => 8
5 minus 3 => 2
5 times 3 => 15
10 divided by 4 => 2.5
3 multiplied by 4 => 12
3 x 4 => 12
10 modulo 4 => 2

// Implicit multiplication
2(3 + 4) => 14
(1 + 2)(3 + 4) => 21
2pi => 6.2831853072

// Errors show nothing
1 / 0 => (none)
2 + => (none)
3 cats and 2 dogs => (none)
(-1)! => (none)

// Lenient input
2 + 2 = => 4
(2 + 3 => 5
